{"role":"assistant","content":"The logs confirm three independent failures: the browser’s GET navigation omits the SPA auth header, the authorize URL duplicates OAuth scopes, and the backend invents a one-hour expiry for a token response that has no expiry. I’m also checking the token exchange and revoked-token path so the whole flow is corrected, not just the button.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_MwxPl8mWXzrkr5QyDZKfybaU","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"git status --short\",\"cwd\":\"/private/tmp/h-RW9w0r\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"tool_CurLx53vgbdWrORkUFY2ODq3","function":{"name":"Glob","arguments":"{\"pattern\":\"**/*{test,spec}*\",\"path\":\"/private/tmp/h-RW9w0r\"}"}}]}
