{"role":"assistant","content":"Fixed the Intervals.icu integration.\n\n- Connect now uses authenticated `POST /auth/init` and redirects to the returned `authorize_url` (`static/app.js`, `server.py`).\n- Removed duplicate activity and calendar scopes (`config.py`).\n- Removed the synthetic one-hour expiry and refresh loop. Tokens remain connected until Intervals.icu returns 401, which now clears the token and shows “revoked, reconnect.”\n- Corrected token exchange to send only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.\n\n`ANSWER.md` documents the root causes, fixes, verification, and exactly which parts of the colleague’s note applied.\n\nValidation passed for Python/JavaScript syntax, the SPA Connect handler, and the full backend flow against a local mock—including two-hour token persistence and revocation handling. No live Intervals.icu account was available for external verification."}
